[{"code":"list_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":19,"col":22},"end":{"line":19,"col":37}},"title":"LIST MAY BE SHARED","message":"`Rolled` changes a list it is handed in place, and the checker cannot show that\nnothing else still holds the list.\n\n19|            ( rolls, Random.generate (Random.list (Random.int 1 6) 3) Rolled )\n                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n\nCopy the list with `List.copy` before it is changed, so the change cannot reach\nanything else that holds it.\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: Random.generate sends what\nit returns, and it returns what Random.generate hands it, which may hold a list\nthe checker cannot place — from JavaScript, or through a call it does not see\ninto."}]
